<p style="text-align: center;">Rock Hill Window. &nbsp;Approx 4"x7", oil on linen. 2013</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">A small sketch done in the studio: I wanted to take a simple subject and paint it well. Most of my attention was given to paint thickness and edge work but there is also some color and temperature variation in the wall. &nbsp;The whites have a bit of cadmium yellow in them which isn't very noticeable in this photograph.</p>